<title>UK: AfDB sets 500 mln French franc TEC10-linked bond.</title>
<headline>AfDB sets 500 mln French franc TEC10-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Commercial de France.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AFRICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN FFR   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY    25.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   TEC10 LINKED  ISS PRICE  100.225   PAY DATE    25.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    100.225   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AA+   LISTING    PARIS     SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	**FOR YEARS 1-3, THEN TEC10 MINUS 94 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
